# RecordSetu AI/OCR Module

This module processes land-record documents using OCR and extracts important fields into structured JSON.

## AI Pipeline

Document / Image
↓
Preprocessing
↓
Hindi OCR
↓
OCR Confidence
↓
Field Extraction
↓
Final Confidence
↓
Structured JSON

## Extracted Fields

The AI/OCR module currently extracts:

- Khasra Number
- Owner Name
- Village
- District
- Area
- Area Unit

## Output Format

Example:

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "source": "ai/samples/land_record_20.png",
  "ocr_text": "राज्य : उत्तर प्रदेश...",
  "ocr_confidence": 0.92,
  "fields": {
    "khasra_no": "975",
    "owner_name": "दीपक अग्रवाल",
    "village": "नौगांव",
    "district": "मथुरा",
    "area": "0.950",
    "area_unit": "हे०",
    "confidence": 0.95
  }
}